WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.606
Three days at the forge
had failed to produce

00:00:03.606 --> 00:00:05.481
an auger for those timbers.

00:00:05.481 --> 00:00:07.323
There was still the schooner’s dinghy.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.550
They raised her sides.
She would carry three.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.587
Henry and George would need
another boat to come back for them.

